ith my situation  it's like what's next  two days later she was hospitalized with  symptoms  a health and housing crisis colliding  now i did speak to her on the phone and  she is out of the hospital thankfully  and doing much better  as for shamika rollins her landlord said  that they offer rent relief programs and  always encourage tenants to seek help  through state  programs and for catherine azar her  landlord said that she's tried to work  something out with azar  but so far they haven't been able to  reach an agreement  eureka very very difficult situation  just how this pandemic is affecting  people in so many other ways adriana  thank you
 

